# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your own values.
#
# `.env.local` is gitignored and read once by the CLI entry point before a runtime is
# opened; the values reach the provider adapters through the existing `Environment`
# port at call time. This template is committed, so it must never hold a credential —
# every entry below is a name with no value, and an empty entry grants nothing.

# TypeSafe — the JEV / decision layer. Read only by the TypeSafe decision provider.
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=

# OpenRouter — the frontier's model execution provider. Read only by the OpenRouter
# provider adapter. It is a different credential from the one above: neither can
# satisfy the other's variable.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
